  "item": [
    {
      "id": "b6bfe365-f7c3-4efd-9003-4185a4958d8c",
      "name": "mining",
      "description": {
        "content": "The Mining API of Chainweb node is disabled by default. It can be enabled\nand configured in the configuration file.\n\n\nThe mining API consists of the following endpoints that\nare described in detail on the\n[Chainweb mining wiki page](https://github.com/kadena-io/chainweb-node/wiki/Mining-API)\n\n*   `GET mining/work`\n*   `POST mining/solved`\n*   `GET mining/updates`\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
